--- !u!1 &45351941
GameObject:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  serializedVersion: 6
  m_Component:
  - component: {fileID: 45351944}
  - component: {fileID: 45351943}
  - component: {fileID: 45351942}
  m_Layer: 0
  m_Name: Dialogue_Beat0_Briefing
  m_TagString: Untagged
  m_Icon: {fileID: 0}
  m_NavMeshLayer: 0
  m_StaticEditorFlags: 0
  m_IsActive: 1
--- !u!114 &45351942
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 45351941}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51bf743a7b9a61e409329faa416e2f81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Ronin7.World::Ronin7.World.Story.DialoguePlayer
  lines:
  - speaker: Resh
    text: Every kid I ever pulled out of those markets was tagged for one address.
      This one. They don't sell children here. They make them. Whole.
    seconds: 14
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bf8e23b0c8f10684889c9fc1db3712ba, type: 3}
  - speaker: Resh
    text: One card left to play. A Program engineer inside the walls, been slipping
      me children for years and never asked for anything back. A name and nothing
      else. Morrigan.
    seconds: 13
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6168b823b3f512c4c80c041d505e34d1, type: 3}
  - speaker: Mera Voss
    text: Then understand what the name buys you. This isn't a free-port, Resh. Real
      soldiers. Real air cover. Nowhere to disappear if it goes wrong.
    seconds: 12
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ef93934b5d398694caf18a97b3a5b33e, type: 3}
  - speaker: Iris
    text: That spine is where they do everything. The switches, the bonding, the
      conditioning. All of it, one mountain. Whatever they did to Cipher, they do
      it here, to a new batch every season. I want it read.
    seconds: 15
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0ae97870d7f67d24a858020301c1b343, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: I hear all of that, and I'm counting the bodies it costs. Tell me why we
      walk into the Dominion's own house instead of around it.
    seconds: 11
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 31c6b985f49a82b4e8dfb15dbbddb40c, type: 3}
  - speaker: Resh
    text: Because around it just means more of them grow up into the thing we keep
      fighting. You want to stop bleeding downstream. This is the top of it. There's
      nothing above this.
    seconds: 12
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d7d7cbd116d49634abd02c76975a322b, type: 3}
  - speaker: Mira
    text: It looks like a school.
    seconds: 2
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0a91bb352004dc6498b6c2afb7e92dfe, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: It's made to look like one. That's the trick of it. And it's why you're
      staying sealed aboard with the hatch shut and the comm open.
    seconds: 11
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 941653cf378fe43428400e5cd7a97c03, type: 3}
  - speaker: Mira
    text: Okay. But the other children. Somebody's getting them out.
    seconds: 3
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6bfcdd964ee339b419e72d20ab8844e7, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: Somebody is.
    seconds: 1
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 53c3b5e67615ef348aaef760d978684c, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: We go shut down the place that's still turning out more like me.
    seconds: 5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e378bc482bb65724aa00fb32635db0cd, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: All right. We do it Resh's way. Plot the slope, drop him low and far, let
      the mountain be the door.
    seconds: 10
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f2e74f89c6288654d97bc4018faa3c62, type: 3}
  textMesh: {fileID: 102165878}
  panelRoot: {fileID: 795470898}
  audioSource: {fileID: 45351943}
  billboardToCamera: 1
  playOnStart: 0
  followDistance: 1.5
  followVerticalOffset: -0.55
  followLerp: 12
  maxCharsPerLine: 36
  autoAdvanceBeat: 0.45
  advanceAction: {fileID: -3790664182463143341, guid: d5a2441a867c2484c888f3631c932d48, type: 3}
