--- !u!114 &156881083
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 156881082}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51bf743a7b9a61e409329faa416e2f81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Ronin7.World::Ronin7.World.Story.DialoguePlayer
  lines:
  - speaker: Drillmaster Caradoc
    text: Stand down, all of you. I've watched you cut through my floor, and I want
      a turn. You kill with my spacing, my count. That's my work standing in front
      of me with a sword.
    seconds: 14
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8c2c8b100ba26354a88ed8137fe65bdf, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: I move like yours because you made me move like yours. Don't put your name
      on it.
    seconds: 6
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6b2f59ab6e7a0d14fa37d21647100527, type: 3}
  - speaker: Drillmaster Caradoc
    text: Proud? There's no proud in it, boy. Some break and some get broke. Somebody's
      got to do the breaking or the galaxy eats them whole. I made you hard enough
      to stand here. You're welcome.
    seconds: 14
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c90d300719ef84440b8694f77068b106, type: 3}
  - speaker: Echo
    text: He ran the floor you were beaten on, Cipher. I logged every hour of it.
      Don't trade blows with him to prove a point. Just end it.
    seconds: 9
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9043de1dda0776b468641917daf1b0b6, type: 3}
  - speaker: Drillmaster Caradoc
    text: Should've known. Soft hands at the top, soft hands at the bottom. Go on.
      Do the honest thing, at least.
    seconds: 9
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 03d2e768431dd0342bcea58528d9c598, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: The honest thing is the children walking out of here. You don't get to
      be part of that.
    seconds: 7
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d8c7000a641bd654f80da5728d42caa0, type: 3}
  textMesh: {fileID: 605334924}
  panelRoot: {fileID: 1666959574}
  audioSource: {fileID: 156881084}
  billboardToCamera: 1
  playOnStart: 0
  followDistance: 1.5
  followVerticalOffset: -0.55
  followLerp: 12
  maxCharsPerLine: 36
  autoAdvanceBeat: 0.45
  advanceAction: {fileID: -3790664182463143341, guid: d5a2441a867c2484c888f3631c932d48, type: 3}
