  - component: {fileID: 416671182}
  - component: {fileID: 416671181}
  - component: {fileID: 416671180}
  m_Layer: 0
  m_Name: Dialogue_Beat4_Confession
  m_TagString: Untagged
  m_Icon: {fileID: 0}
  m_NavMeshLayer: 0
  m_StaticEditorFlags: 0
  m_IsActive: 1
--- !u!114 &416671180
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 416671179}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51bf743a7b9a61e409329faa416e2f81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Ronin7.World::Ronin7.World.Story.DialoguePlayer
  lines:
  - speaker: Master Kaelen
    text: There. Now I can say the part I built my whole life around not saying.
      You think the feeling is a wound. A thing that happened to you.
    seconds: 9
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 13959ca95d67cf3419d9e53dc4d1ae3d, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: Isn't it.
    seconds: 1
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9098606f9354ccd428ec93f0756aec3a, type: 3}
  - speaker: Master Kaelen
    text: No. We built you hollow on purpose. A soldier who feels, hesitates. A soldier
      who hesitates, fails. So we reach in and cut it out, every time, by hand. The
      hollow isn't a side effect. We were aiming for it.
    seconds: 18
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9562df6b072faa840a6bbb668a65f8ed, type: 3}
  - speaker: Master Kaelen
    text: But you can't pour nothing into a vessel and seal it shut forever. Somewhere
      along the seam the weld stays weak, and in the rare ones, it opens. And what
      comes through the seam isn't damage. It's the thing we worked hardest to keep
      out. Mercy.
    seconds: 21
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 43a421b553ad93245b46b2c342aa7c69, type: 3}
  - speaker: Master Kaelen
    text: Your hesitation, the thing the floor reports flagged as a fault. It was
      never a fault. The seam was just giving way. That's all you are. The prayer
      that didn't take.
    seconds: 15
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7e639dc32cfdc2048ad4999193727cd8, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: Then I'm exactly what you were afraid of.
    seconds: 4
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 40837cdd1bf041d4c81c43b46636a6b1, type: 3}
  - speaker: Master Kaelen
    text: You're exactly what we made. And exactly what we couldn't stand to admit
      we made.
    seconds: 5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 732ac8d8a8294754cbbfd08076149bac, type: 3}
  - speaker: Echo
    text: I logged that second as a fault, Cipher, same as they did. Neither of us
      knew what we were looking at.
    seconds: 8
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 299916660b84eba4189f71d0b9f1a49b, type: 3}
  textMesh: {fileID: 1083045254}
  panelRoot: {fileID: 812063325}
  audioSource: {fileID: 416671181}
  billboardToCamera: 1
  playOnStart: 0
  followDistance: 1.5
  followVerticalOffset: -0.55
  followLerp: 12
  maxCharsPerLine: 36
  autoAdvanceBeat: 0.45
  advanceAction: {fileID: -3790664182463143341, guid: d5a2441a867c2484c888f3631c932d48, type: 3}
