  m_NavMeshLayer: 0
  m_StaticEditorFlags: 0
  m_IsActive: 1
--- !u!114 &1233358230
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1233358229}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51bf743a7b9a61e409329faa416e2f81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Ronin7.World::Ronin7.World.Story.DialoguePlayer
  lines:
  - speaker: Morrigan
    text: I've read everything that's come through this rock for years, and two things
      never fit. One, the Program's own actions don't add up to what happened to
      you. Someone outside the Program is steering this. I don't know who. But the
      pattern's not theirs.
    seconds: 18
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 70ae4ee4168b51b49a5450ad5e0f941e, type: 3}
  - speaker: Morrigan
    text: Two. Everything built in this rock, the switches, the bonding, all of it,
      traces back through every revision to one mind. One insider on the Program's
      own side. I've chased him nine years and never got a name. I mean to.
    seconds: 17
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 952b7780b56031443b41d5dc619845d2, type: 3}
  - speaker: Echo
    text: That's the first time anyone's said out loud this is bigger than your handler
      and your switch, Cipher. She's not wrong, and she's the first one with the
      eyes to see it. Keep her.
    seconds: 12
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5b017a8739b272749949a21284096367, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: Then you berth aboard the Cairn with the rest of us. There's a training
      bay in her belly we never named. We'll call it after the thing we just brought
      down, so we remember what it was for.
    seconds: 14
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c20625c664ff43743b923922d46c0631, type: 3}
  - speaker: Morrigan
    text: A dead leviathan full of strays, and now a rogue engineer too. Fine. Give
      me a bench and the time, and I'll take your leash apart. Then I'll take apart
      the man who designed it.
    seconds: 13
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4060cfee0b523a042b44be8dd8962a39, type: 3}
  textMesh: {fileID: 1210966931}
  panelRoot: {fileID: 537359989}
  audioSource: {fileID: 1233358231}
  billboardToCamera: 1
  playOnStart: 0
  followDistance: 1.5
  followVerticalOffset: -0.55
  followLerp: 12
  maxCharsPerLine: 36
  autoAdvanceBeat: 0.45
  advanceAction: {fileID: -3790664182463143341, guid: d5a2441a867c2484c888f3631c932d48, type: 3}
