--- !u!114 &1406278129
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1406278128}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51bf743a7b9a61e409329faa416e2f81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Ronin7.World::Ronin7.World.Story.DialoguePlayer
  lines:
  - speaker: Echo
    text: Look at them, Cipher. That's you, a year before the bay. You don't have
      to kill the ones still mostly children under it. The metal cadre, yes. Them,
      you can choose.
    seconds: 12
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f063f95548b6d8c4c9bba5181d3068a6, type: 3}
  - speaker: Master Kaelen
    text: You can stop swinging. They'll keep coming until I tell them not to, and
      I'm not going to. Unless you're the rare thing the floor reports say you are.
      The hand that hesitates. Go on. Spare one. I'd genuinely like to see it.
    seconds: 17
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5e034a7ee78f5e446bddd1401d654a0b, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: They're children with your knives put in them. The knives are yours. So
      you're the one I came up here for.
    seconds: 7
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8050cb897d58ecc4e8443cd3b09539cd, type: 3}
  - speaker: Master Kaelen
    text: My knives, yes, I'll own them. Hespa thinks she's a mother. Caradoc thinks
      he's a forge. Me, I've read the plans, and I build it anyway. Come and read
      it back to me.
    seconds: 16
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0a4be6f43c5810a48be9595e0261ae5d, type: 3}
  textMesh: {fileID: 1975929304}
  panelRoot: {fileID: 1288835853}
  audioSource: {fileID: 1406278130}
  billboardToCamera: 1
  playOnStart: 0
  followDistance: 1.5
  followVerticalOffset: -0.55
  followLerp: 12
  maxCharsPerLine: 36
  autoAdvanceBeat: 0.45
  advanceAction: {fileID: -3790664182463143341, guid: d5a2441a867c2484c888f3631c932d48, type: 3}
