--- !u!114 &1774432286
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1774432285}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51bf743a7b9a61e409329faa416e2f81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Ronin7.World::Ronin7.World.Story.DialoguePlayer
  lines:
  - speaker: Matron Hespa
    text: There now. Don't mind the noise, my loves. Eyes on me. We were on our numbers,
      weren't we.
    seconds: 6
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a3d1c492a4f09ab40aae3619a12ae450, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: Step away from the child.
    seconds: 2
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 17903db6268b30644bd8c5fc5f43eba9, type: 3}
  - speaker: Matron Hespa
    text: I don't hurt them. I take the hurting things away from them. I'm the kindest
      thing that ever happens to them. You walked in here with a sword. Which of
      us is the cruel one?
    seconds: 16
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 86c2ace500b8de447a5cae8d9157b072, type: 3}
  - speaker: Echo
    text: She means it, Cipher, that's the worst of it. She did it to a thousand
      kids and tucked every one in after. Don't let the soft voice slow your hand.
    seconds: 11
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fe9ec17e73a254f45b0d3bbb68699eb5, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: I had a number once. Somebody soft as you gave it to me. You don't get
      to keep doing it.
    seconds: 7
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fec5c0b1cb8c053498da47c4bcc8643e, type: 3}
  textMesh: {fileID: 109031024}
  panelRoot: {fileID: 117847009}
  audioSource: {fileID: 1774432287}
  billboardToCamera: 1
  playOnStart: 0
  followDistance: 1.5
  followVerticalOffset: -0.55
  followLerp: 12
  maxCharsPerLine: 36
  autoAdvanceBeat: 0.45
  advanceAction: {fileID: -3790664182463143341, guid: d5a2441a867c2484c888f3631c932d48, type: 3}
