--- !u!114 &2049921674
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2049921673}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51bf743a7b9a61e409329faa416e2f81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Ronin7.World::Ronin7.World.Story.DialoguePlayer
  lines:
  - speaker: Morrigan
    text: All three. I felt the floor go still. Nine years, and you did it in an
      afternoon. Don't say anything yet. Help me open the doors before the garrison
      works out there's no one left giving them orders.
    seconds: 14
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7d04d14ca87e44b47b4cf0db8f03de01, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: Hundreds of them, and one shuttle. You don't carry this off a mountain.
      So how does it walk?
    seconds: 6
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 31badac51b985de4eb1a00857e8bf3c0, type: 3}
  - speaker: Morrigan
    text: We're not carrying anyone. We let them walk, and we trust them to, which
      this place never once did. Eldest at the front and the back, counting heads
      the whole way down. Resh's name opens the doors at the bottom. Any other way
      and they're just freight again.
    seconds: 22
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ebce9d1c17ef33243881582df1c6ba6c, type: 3}
  textMesh: {fileID: 1262975908}
  panelRoot: {fileID: 554884617}
  audioSource: {fileID: 2049921675}
  billboardToCamera: 1
  playOnStart: 0
  followDistance: 1.5
  followVerticalOffset: -0.55
  followLerp: 12
  maxCharsPerLine: 36
  autoAdvanceBeat: 0.45
  advanceAction: {fileID: -3790664182463143341, guid: d5a2441a867c2484c888f3631c932d48, type: 3}
